{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38863","headline":"将入关安陆遇兵寇 · 杜荀鹤","name":"将入关安陆遇兵寇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家贫无计早离家，离得家来蹇滞多。\n已是数程行雨雪，更堪中路阻兵戈。\n几州户口看成血，一旦天心却许和。\n四面烟尘少无处，不知吾土自如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}